WEBVTT

00:04:24.208 --> 00:04:30.434
They achieved this by building
the largest internal metagenomics database

00:04:30.458 --> 00:04:34.184
of cells, enzymes and genetic programming

00:04:34.208 --> 00:04:36.309
by combining robotics,

00:04:36.333 --> 00:04:37.768
protein design,

00:04:37.792 --> 00:04:39.643
both in microorganism

00:04:39.667 --> 00:04:41.101
and mammalian cells

00:04:41.125 --> 00:04:42.559
and data science.

00:04:42.583 --> 00:04:46.018
They have built
a cell programming platform

00:04:46.042 --> 00:04:50.059
able to create nearly
any organism they want

00:04:50.083 --> 00:04:52.393
by converging science,

00:04:52.417 --> 00:04:53.684
technology

00:04:53.708 --> 00:04:55.518
and data and digital platform

00:04:55.542 --> 00:05:01.393
then to become the Amazon
web services of biology,